{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>WARNING:</i></strong><i> The following game demo contains haunting imagery of a dinosaur possibly chasing you, the player, and said dinosaur possibly jumpscaring you at some point. Do not play this game if you are not brave enough for the possibility of confronting a dinosaur.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Dinosaur is a thrilling game that involves you, the player, navigating various maze-like levels in order to find your way out and avoiding being caught by a dinosaur.\u00a0 With at least 20 levels of gameplay, you, the player, must use your wits to navigate increasingly challenging mazes in order to find an escape and evade the wrath of a dinosaur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/00a3d2d4bf0c734b80eabd97247e2f46.poster.avif?t=1755300487\" width=672 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/00a3d2d4bf0c734b80eabd97247e2f46.webm?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/00a3d2d4bf0c734b80eabd97247e2f46.mp4?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find keys to unlock doors, literally opening new environments to explore and furthering your way to finding an exit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/e5903955dd74161f9db8d602ffe89e01.poster.avif?t=1755300487\" width=672 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/e5903955dd74161f9db8d602ffe89e01.webm?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/e5903955dd74161f9db8d602ffe89e01.mp4?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid obstacles such as mud puddles that impede your progress, lest you succumb to a wandering dinosaur.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/46cac746f05d1c39866224d82bf91161.poster.avif?t=1755300487\" width=672 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/46cac746f05d1c39866224d82bf91161.webm?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/46cac746f05d1c39866224d82bf91161.mp4?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to escape the terror of the <strong>Hidden Dinosaur</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/e71c27c4946e27ed2bcbba84a4531027.poster.avif?t=1755300487\" width=672 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/e71c27c4946e27ed2bcbba84a4531027.webm?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944160/extras/e71c27c4946e27ed2bcbba84a4531027.mp4?t=1755300487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","backgroun